ed fourth among his brothers. During the period when Sun Quan was tormented over the question of succession, Sun Ba and his elder brother Sun He engaged in fierce open and covert struggles within the palace. This rivalry split the Wu court into two factions. Ultimately, Sun Quan chose to cut his losses by deposing Sun He and ordering Sun Ba to commit suicide, thus ending the Struggle of the Two Palaces.","jp":"孫権の四男。孫権が後継者問題に苦慮する中、兄の孫和と宮廷内で激しい権力争いを繰り広げ、呉の臣下たちも二派に分かれて対立することとなった。最終的に事態の収拾を図った孫権により、孫和は廃嫡され、孫覇は自害を命じられ、こうして「二宮の変」は幕を閉じた。","kr":"손권의 넷째 아들입니다. 손권이 후계자 문제를 두고 고심하던 시기, 손패는 형인 손화와 궁내에서 암투를 벌였고, 이로 인해 오나라의 여러 신하들 또한 두 파벌로 갈라서게 되었습니다. 결국 손권은 사태를 수습하고자 어쩔 수 없이 손화를 폐위하고 손패에게 자결을 명하면서 이궁의 변을 종식시켰습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10517","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"霸","nameTc":"霸","nameEn":"Ba","nameJp":"覇","nameKr":"패","nameOther":"","word":"子威","wordTc":"子威","wordEn":"Ziwei","wordJp":"子威","wordKr":"자위","wordOther":"","icon":"孙霸","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"241","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"36","force":"60","wise":"63","politics":"67","charm":"63","will":"46","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"19/19/19/19/19/63/31/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1200","battleSoulPoint":"3600","debateSoulPoint":"3900","strategy":"1006815","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/0/1/0/0/1/1/2/0/2/1/1/3/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"86","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-1800